{
"content_id": "9103",
"reference_id": 8271,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Yeast",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "yeast",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>YEAST</h1><p>A yeast is a tiny living fungus that makes bread rise and grow bigger when added to dough. In the Bible, it is also called leaven.</p><p><em>See</em> <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"5872\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">Leaven</data>.</p>",
