"title": "Yiron",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "yiron",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>YIRON</h1><p>One of the fortified cities of Naphtali’s tribe (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06019038\" data-end-ref=\"06019038\">Jos 19:38</data>). Some have identified Yiron with the present village of Jarun, southeast of Bint Jebeil.</p>",
